00:04:33.116 --> 00:04:37.016
young people's mental health concerns have been growing significantly," she said.

00:04:37.356 --> 00:04:41.336
And the first thing a new minister should grasp is that children and youth are not adults.

00:04:41.756 --> 00:04:45.556
The law, as she describes it, is mostly about detaining someone in crisis.

00:04:46.056 --> 00:04:50.296
She wants more publicly funded voluntary care that could steady young people in the community.

00:04:50.736 --> 00:04:54.556
Post media news reported this week that youth mental health problems are rising,

00:04:54.956 --> 00:04:56.276
and that wait lists are long.

00:04:56.856 --> 00:05:00.656
Charles Worth said parents tell her they asked for help over and over and over again.

00:05:00.656 --> 00:05:04.456
