00:05:14.356 --> 00:05:16.796
She had already pressed the previous NDP government.

00:05:17.156 --> 00:05:20.676
That government added voluntary options, including foundry centers,

00:05:20.676 --> 00:05:23.416
she said, and demand still outruns the services.

00:05:23.936 --> 00:05:28.456
Her recent report found an average of 1,600 teens, ages 12 to 17,

00:05:28.456 --> 00:05:33.736
in voluntarily detained under the Mental Health Act each year from 2020 through 2025.

00:05:34.076 --> 00:05:37.736
That was 14 times the rate at which the Justice System detained youth.

00:05:38.076 --> 00:05:41.396
In the campaign, the Conservatives promised to review the Mental Health Act,

00:05:41.796 --> 00:05:45.456
shortened weights and expand early services. She supports those directions.

00:05:45.916 --> 00:05:49.496
She is more worried about a pledge to push anti-drug education in schools,

00:05:49.916 --> 00:05:53.916
which she said has failed before, and about a promise to expand mandatory care

00:05:53.916 --> 00:05:56.416
for people who may be at risk to themselves or others.

00:05:56.416 --> 00:06:00.456
community support is often missing when those young people are released," she said.

00:06:00.896 --> 00:06:05.136
An evident suggest forced treatment can put long-term recovery and survival at risk.

